From 2f495e74077186fecdfb75abc12380b360cc46c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:42:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(tools): HSK, DIN 69871 SK and router ISO30 holders
 in the holder library

Add HSK-A63, HSK-F63, HSK-E40 and HSK-E32 (DIN 69893-1/-5/-6) and
SK30, SK40 (DIN 69871 / ISO 7388-1) and the router ISO30 to the
built-in holder library, each with ER collet chucks and Weldon
side-lock holders, drawn by the existing conservative outline laws.
The numbers and their sources are in
docs/decisions/3919-standard-holders.md. ISO20/25, R8 and SF32 wait
for missing numbers (recorded there).

Refs #3919

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
